# Every text file is checked out with LF on every platform: the embedded
# demo project and report template, the golden files and the course pages
# are compared or served byte for byte, and a CRLF checkout on Windows
# would change what the binary ships and what the tests expect.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
